# Conformance probe pack for ruling 14 of 0.56: a wrapped field under a look-ahead
# window (0.33). Most significant bit first. Public. One kind.
format  conformance-range-056-8
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
kind    a
requires probe.x
when    8  1  at 0
field   probe.x  8  uint  range 0 10 wrap
